'''Eye Guy''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Opticoid (Classic)|Opticoid]] from the planet [[Sightra]].{{Refn|
At the time of creating Eye Guy, his species name was not specified.{{Refn|[[:File:OS crew didn't name Eye Guy's Species.png]]|group = TNP}}{{Refn|[[:File:OS crew didn't define Eye Guy's Species.png]]|group = TNP}} It is unclear if this changed further along production. However, on July 4, 2009, Eye Guy's page was edited by an anonymous user, who claimed Eye Guy was an [[Opticoid (Classic)|Opticoid]] from the planet [[Sightra]]. The page for Opticoids was created on September 14, 2009 by another anonymous user, while the page for Sightra was created on October 19, 2009 by user [[User:The Ultimate Necrofriggian|The Ultimate Necrofriggian]]. No source for Opticoid or Sightra was provided in any of these instances, and they were not mentioned in any official media or merchandise. In ''[[FusionFall]]'', released in 2009, Eye Guy was mentioned as being a "Scleran".{{Refn|''[[FusionFall]]''; [[:File:Scleran Proof.png|file]]|group = og}} The master brief for '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' listed Eye Guy as an Opticoid from the planet Sightra,{{Refn|[[:File:Scan 12.png]]|group = OV Brief|name = link}} thus canonizing them as his species and planet, respectively.
{{Refn|[[Ben 10 Planet:Longstanding Misinformation]]|group = BTP}}|group = note}}

==Appearance==
Eye Guy's entire upper-body is covered with green eyes, around 20 of them; although he ironically has no eyes on his face, which consists of a mouth, and a very large pair of elastic<ref name="IaMMMBW2"/> bat-like ears. He has dark tan skin on his back and feet, with a lighter tone of tan on his chest, armpits, face, and hands. His entire skeleton is made of cartilage, not bones.{{Refn|group = OV Brief|name = link}}

In the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]''', Eye Guy wore black pants with white bands on them and a white belt with the [[Omnitrix (Original)|original Omnitrix]] symbol on it. He had light green eyes with dark green pupils, and one giant primary eye in the center of his chest.

In the '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' [[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)/Theme Song|intro]], Eye Guy looked the same as before, except the big eye on his chest was replaced by his [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', 16-year-old Eye Guy's eyes are now bigger, recolored slightly brighter, and placed symmetrically on his body. His chest eye is now closed by default, and he now has two additional eyes on his palms. His pants now have green cuffs replacing the white bands; the main belt where the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol is located is recolored green with a white stripe; and he additionally wears green cuffs on his hands. Much like in the case of [[Cannonbolt (Classic)|Cannonbolt]], Eye Guy's teeth may alternate between being sharp like his '''Original Series''' design or being flat.

11-year-old Eye Guy looks mostly the same as he did in the '''Original Series''', albeit he has the palm eyes, eye placement, and pupil color of his 16-year-old self. He wears black foot sleeves; white bands respective to the green cuffs; and the original Omnitrix symbol on his belt is recolored green.

